 r←Test_AskString_004(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;parms;msg;n;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise the "Create" method with some props.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.caption←0⊃⎕XSI
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 myGuiParms.TestMode←0

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Request.CreateParmsForString
 parms.addToCaption←'My request'
 parms.question←'Please enter your name:' '(Surname, first name)'
 parms.default←'Kai Thomas Max Jaeger'
 parms.maxLength←60
 parms.timeout←0.1
 parms.autoPress←0

 n←myGuiParms parms(#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Request.CreateParmsForString ∆Ask)''
 ⎕DL 0.2
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0=n.Progressbar.Visible
 ⎕NQ n.Input'GotFocus'
 ⎕NQ n.Btn1'GotFocus'
 2 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →T.GoToTidyUp 1=n.Progressbar.Visible
 ⎕NQ n.Btn1'Select'
 →T.GoToTidyUp~0∊⍴n.∆result
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠n.∆OK
 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
